  "_comment": [
    "Maps original SimWorld class paths (what the python client sends to vset /objects/spawn_bp_asset and /objects/spawn)",
    "to classes that exist in this project: C++ classes of the SimWorld game module (see docs/ACTORS.md).",
    "City props share a few classes; each actor picks its placeholder size from the asset name inside its own name",
    "(generate_world names nodes GEN_<asset>_..., see Source/SimWorld/Public/SWProp.h).",
    "Empty string = not mapped: SimCV then tries to load the original path, which fails until that asset exists here.",
    "Keys are matched case-insensitively. Reloaded at startup; override the file with -cvredirects=/abs/path.json."
